# --- Audio ---
# No third-party audio in the repo (SPEC §0): backing is procedural, user
# samples come in through the file picker, and factory kits dumped off the
# Field for the format spike are TE's. Tests generate the audio they need.
*.aif
*.aiff
*.aifc
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.ogg
*.m4a
*.aac
*.opus

